{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id501376524"}, "name":{"label":"Benjclark"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-11T19:57:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11482937117"}, "title":{"label":"Simple and Very Effective"}, "content":{"label":"I have been on a journey of Technological Minimalism for some time, now, and have landed on the idea that the minimalist dumb/smart phones on the market are (albeit beautiful) a little under equipped for what I need. \nI need a smart phone with the tools available to an iPhone but without the addictive motions, animations, colours and access to infinite feeds. \n\nFor me, my iPhone SE with this app has answered that prayer! \n\nA clean, text based, interface but access to Banks, Study tools and WhatsApp! \n\n(Also, I had one little issue with the Grey app section at the bottom and the creator directly responded with the solution. That’s customer service!)\n\nWell worth the small one off cost!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id158391046"}, "name":{"label":"noiseWizard"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-09T15:30:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.0"}, "id":{"label":"11474653729"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely incredible."}, "content":{"label":"Recently changed my settings to display grayscale however I still wasn’t satisfied with how busy the screen can feel.\n\nSaw a couple of people use the app recently, and as soon as I found out what it was called, I downloaded the app 20 minutes ago, and have come back to review.\n\nAbsolutely amazing, this is exactly what I’ve been looking for. The app is so well thought out, so well designed and the inclusion of video tutorials wasn’t needed, but nonetheless appreciated.\n\nBest $8 I’ve spent on the App Store. The idea of making the menu items widgets is such a clever idea.\n\nSuggestion: it would be amazing to integrate with Apple Reminders api so i could use my Apple reminders, but through your awesome, clean lense.\n\nEven without this addition, i still love what you’ve done here.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=6480082872&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
